    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      271.67,
      455.49,
      328.53
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends paragraph (e) of subsection (3) of section 6 of the CivilAviation Act, No. 14 of 2010, and the legal effect of the section as amended is to providefor more than one Service Provider to be appointed for supplying aeronautical servicesreferred to in that paragraph and to remove the limitation relating to the appointment ofService Provider, such being the appointment of public corporation or a company inwhich the Government holds a majority of shares as the Service Provider.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
