      169.77,
      230.17,
      393.93,
      241.24
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CIVIL AVIATION ACT, NO. 14 OF 2010",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      254.89,
      401.92,
      277.96
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      290.89,
      401.91,
      313.96
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Civil Aviation (Amendment)Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      326.89,
      401.9,
      373.96
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 6 of the Civil Aviation Act, No. 14 of 2010 ishereby amended in subsection (3) thereof, by the repeal ofparagraph (e) and the substitution therefor, of the followingparagraph:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      191.85,
      386.89,
      401.88,
      445.96
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(e) appoint one or more persons to be ServiceProviders for providing aeronautical servicesspecified in paragraph (i), (j), (k), (l) or (m) ofsection 31 at any Aerodrome specified inparagraphs (a) and (b) of that section:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      213.81,
      458.89,
      401.89,
      553.96
    ],
    "text": "Provided that where a Service Providerappointed under this paragraph does notconsent to provide the aeronautical servicesreferred to therein at any Aerodrome specifiedin paragraph (a) or (b) of section 31, the Ministermay appoint any other Service Provider toprovide the aeronautical services referred to inthis paragraph.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      566.89,
      401.86,
      589.96
    ],
    "text": "3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
